@page "/help"

<h1 class="fx-page-title">Help</h1>
<p class="fx-page-sub">Understand how everything in Fenrix works — screen by screen, and concept by concept.</p>

<div class="fx-grid cols-3">
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="play" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Getting started</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            Create your first project, import an existing one, and run your first plan and apply.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="book" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Feature guides</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            One guide per area: Projects, Terraform, Plans &amp; safety, Git, Connections, Pipelines.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="dashboard" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Concepts</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            Config vs state, the execution lifecycle, saved-plan safety, and the connections model.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="command" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Command reference</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            Every Terraform and Git command Fenrix runs, with the exact CLI it maps to.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="help" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Troubleshooting</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            Common errors and recovery steps, plus how to export diagnostics.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="fx-card">
        <div style="color:var(--fx-accent);margin-bottom:8px;"><Icon Name="settings" Size="20" /></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;">Shortcuts</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--fx-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
            Full keyboard shortcut list. Press Ctrl+K anywhere for the command palette.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<p style="color:var(--fx-faint);font-size:12px;margin-top:20px;">
    Help content ships with the app and works offline. Contextual "?" panels and command
    explanations appear throughout the product as features are built.
</p>
